# Local development only.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and paste your own key in. The game runs
# fully without one; only the grown-ups' written summary needs it.
#
# The name is commented out on purpose. A host importing this repo scans
# for variables and offers to set them for you, and a VITE_ variable set
# on a deployed site is inlined into the JavaScript it ships, where
# anyone can read it. Uncomment it in .env.local, never on a host.
#
# VITE_DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=sk-your-key-here


# ── Deploying ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# Set these two in the host's environment settings, where they stay on
# the server and the browser never sees them. Without BOTH, the summary
# feature switches itself off.
#
#   DEEPSEEK_API_KEY   your key, with no VITE_ prefix
#   REPORT_PASSWORD    what a visitor types to use the summary
